# Scoring SHA-256s fixture file bytes, so line endings must not vary by platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The six tracked sweep databases are the evidence behind every published number
# (see src/evidence.ts). They are SQLite, so `text=auto` guessing wrong even once
# would rewrite bytes inside pages on checkout and corrupt the record. Marked
# binary explicitly rather than left to detection.
*.db binary
